For the most part, I loved all of Steve's ideas on the shopping
mall level.  I think this would be great!  Here are some 
potential extra ideas on the shopping mall level.

o There should be several fountains on this level.  You should
  be able to pitch gold in these fountains and make a wish with
  a very slim chance that the wish would come true.  Perhaps
  your chances would be improved based on how much money you
  pitch.

o There should be an arcade room.  There should be several 
  arcade style games you could play and if you win(maybe based
  on luck) you get nice prizes (food, armor, weapons, etc.).
  However, there should be a large chance that these prizes
  are just cheap plastic imitations of the real thing.  Also,
  you should have to drop your food before entering (no food
  or drinks allowed in the arcade).  Finally, there should be
  a higher percentage of pickpockets and other like nasties
  in the arcade.  Oh yeah, one last thought, maybe there should
  be some chance that you will be overcome by cigarette smoke
  which increases the longer you stay in the arcade.

These are just a couple more ideas.  IMHO I think the shopping
mall is a great idea and has a lot of potential.  Later....



